  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Setup and Task 0 (generators, transfer matrices, vacua, HW kets, frame tie, exact undo, branches): cells 1–6",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state (this also clears the other new-conventions notebooks session state; their files are untouched); Quiet because the front-end wrapper symbol ClearGlobals is Protected *)\nQuiet[ClearAll[\"Global`*\"]];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators: plain, non-Hermitian, exact rationals, verbatim from L2-310-untwist-CG.wb *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>; tims = <||>;\n(* size of a residual: a numerically exact zero (tracked-precision zero) is reported by its accuracy bound 10^-Accuracy, never as an exact 0 (Clean-CG-combinations trap) *)\nsz[x_] := If[x == 0, 10.^-Accuracy[x], N[Abs[x], 3]];\n(* THE ONLY REP SWITCH is the next line *)\npr = 200; Λ = {2, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL; nilp = Λ[[1]] - Λ[[3]];\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3};\ntPar = (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]])/hN; th12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]; t12 = tPar; y0 = (th12 - hN)/(th12 - 2 hN);\nid1 = IdentityMatrix[d1, SparseArray]; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2, SparseArray];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, Λ]];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], id1];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[id1, Ee[i, j]];\n(* total gl(3) weight of each product basis state, in KroneckerProduct order *)\nwtL1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[wtL1[[i]] + wtL1[[j]], {i, d1}, {j, d1}], 1];\nsecOf[mu_] := secOf[mu] = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, mu]];\nuv[n_] := UnitVector[d1, n]; e1 = uv[1]; u12e1 = e1;\nkron[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[a, b]];\n(* gl(3) commutation relations of JJ (exact) *)\ncomm = Flatten[Table[Normal[Ee[i, j] . Ee[k, l] - Ee[k, l] . Ee[i, j] - (KroneckerDelta[j, k] Ee[i, l] - KroneckerDelta[l, i] Ee[k, j])], {i, 3}, {j, 3}, {k, 3}, {l, 3}]];\nchecks[\"JJ gl(3) relations\"] = Union[comm] === {0};\n(* invariant diagonal metric G (G[[1]] = 1): Ee[i,j]^T G = G Ee[j,i]. JJ is not Hermitian, so projectors must be G-orthogonal (= orthogonal in the Hermitian EH frame) *)\ngv = Array[gg, d1];\ngsol = Solve[Flatten[Append[Table[Transpose[Normal[Ee[i, j]]] . DiagonalMatrix[gv] - DiagonalMatrix[gv] . Normal[Ee[j, i]], {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}], {gv[[1]] - 1}]] == 0, gv];\ngMet = DiagonalMatrix[gv /. First[gsol]];\nchecks[\"G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]\"] = Length[gsol] === 1 && And @@ Positive[Diagonal[gMet]] && And @@ Flatten[Table[Transpose[Normal[Ee[i, j]]] . gMet === gMet . Normal[Ee[j, i]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nchecks[\"nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[If[i == j, True, Max[Abs[Normal[MatrixPower[Ee[i, j], nilp + 1]]]] == 0], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]] && Max[Abs[Normal[MatrixPower[Ee[1, 3], nilp]]]] != 0;\nGrid[Join[{{\"Λ, d1, d2, nilp\", ToString[{Λ, d1, d2, nilp}, InputForm]}, {\"distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights\", {Length[Union[wtBasis]], Length[Union[wtL1]]}}, {\"diag G\", ToString[Diagonal[gMet], InputForm]}, {\"pr, h, θ, z, t = θ12/h\", ToString[{pr, hN, thN, zN, tPar}, InputForm]}}, List @@@ Normal[checks]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c01_setup_gens` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c01_setup_gens\", 0.09, {{\"Λ, d1, d2, nilp\", \"{{2, 1, 0}, 8, 64, 2}\"}, {\"distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights\", {19, 7}}, {\"diag G\", \"{1, 1, 1, 2, 6, 9, 4, 9}\"}, \n  {\"pr, h, θ, z, t = θ12/h\", \"{200, 1/2, {2/7, -3/5}, {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, 62/35}\"}, {\"JJ gl(3) relations\", True}, {\"G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]\", True}, \n  {\"nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0\", True}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c01_setup_gens\", 0.04, {{\"Λ, d1, d2, nilp\", \"{{3, 1, 0}, 15, 225, 3}\"}, {\"distinct total weights, distinct one-site weights\", {36, 12}}, \n  {\"diag G\", \"{1, 1, 2, 3, 24, 32, 4, 12, 24, 64, 288, 576, 36, 128, 576}\"}, {\"pr, h, θ, z, t = θ12/h\", \"{200, 1/2, {2/7, -3/5}, {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, 62/35}\"}, {\"JJ gl(3) relations\", True}, \n  {\"G unique, positive, invariant for all Ee[i,j]\", True}, {\"nilpotency: Ee[i,j]^(nilp+1) = 0 (i != j), Ee[1,3]^nilp != 0\", True}}}\n```",
   "languageId": "markdown",
