  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* monodromy T(v) = L^(1)(v-θ1).L^(2)(v-θ2) (exact, sparse) with the new Lax L_ij(u) = u δ_ij + h E_ij; principal quantum minors t_a (rows antisymmetrized, k-th factor at v-(k-1)h). For a diagonal twist the (I,I) minor is (prod z_I) times the untwisted minor, so the exact basis polynomials tBasisC[a, I] (coefficient matrices of u^j, from exact Lagrange interpolation on the seven points uS) are computed once; any twist costs one N[..] (memoized) and a linear combination. *)\nTm[v_] := Tm[v] = Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) id2 + hN E1[i, k]) . (KroneckerDelta[k, j] (v - thN[[2]]) id2 + hN E2[k, j]), {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nuS = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\nminorAt[I_, v_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[Tm[v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, Length[I]}], {σ, Permutations[I]}];\nvinv = Inverse[Table[uS[[k]]^j, {k, 7}, {j, 0, 6}]];\ntBasisC[a_, I_] := tBasisC[a, I] = With[{ms = Table[minorAt[I, uS[[k]]], {k, 7}]}, Table[Sum[vinv[[j, k]] ms[[k]], {k, 7}], {j, 7}]];\ntBasisN[a_, I_] := tBasisN[a, I] = N[tBasisC[a, I], pr];\n(* t_a(u) as a list of seven numeric coefficient matrices (u^0..u^6) for the diagonal twist zz *)\ntZof[zz_] := tZof[zz] = Table[Sum[(Times @@ zz[[I]]) tBasisN[a, I], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}], {a, 3}];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\nauditNu[hh_, ths_, n_, x_] := Product[x - ths[[s]] + hh Λ[[n]], {s, Length[ths]}];\ntEval[tc_, a_, u0_] := Sum[u0^(j - 1) tc[[a, j]], {j, 7}];\n{tTime, tzTest} = AbsoluteTiming[tZof[N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]]];\n(* quantum determinant: t3(u) = (z1 z2 z3) nu1(u) nu2(u-h) nu3(u-2h) times the identity, at two points *)\nchecks[\"qdet: t3 = chi3 nu1(u)nu2(u-h)nu3(u-2h) (max abs dev, 2 points)\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[Normal[tEval[tzTest, 3, u0] - (3/2 5/4 2/3) auditNu[hN, thN, 1, u0] auditNu[hN, thN, 2, u0 - hN] auditNu[hN, thN, 3, u0 - 2 hN] id2]]], {u0, {1/5, -3/7}}]];\nchecks[\"t_a commute (t1(1/5) t2(2/3) - t2 t1: max abs)\"] = Max[Abs[Normal[tEval[tzTest, 1, 1/5] . tEval[tzTest, 2, 2/3] - tEval[tzTest, 2, 2/3] . tEval[tzTest, 1, 1/5]]]];\nchecks[\"exact degree check: coefficient matrices u^(2a+1..6) of t_a vanish (a=1,2), max abs\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[Normal[tzTest[[a, j]]]]], {a, 2}, {j, 2 a + 2, 7}]];\n(* exact sparse t_a for an ARBITRARY 3x3 twist M (used only for the bra-twist eigen-covector check) *)\nlax1x[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nlax2x[x_] := lax2x[x] = With[{L1 = lax1x[1, x], L2 = lax1x[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[L1[[i, k]], L2[[k, j]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nmono2x[M_][x_] := mono2x[M][x] = Table[Sum[lax2x[x][[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nqminx[M_][rI_, cJ_][x_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono2x[M][x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], cJ[[k]]]], {k, Length[cJ]}], {σ, Permutations[rI]}];\ntLg[a_, x_, M_] := Sum[qminx[M][rows, rows][x], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s): all 7 minor families + one twist\", tTime}, {\"qdet dev\", ScientificForm[sz[checks[\"qdet: t3 = chi3 nu1(u)nu2(u-h)nu3(u-2h) (max abs dev, 2 points)\"]], 3]}, {\"[t1,t2] dev\", ScientificForm[sz[checks[\"t_a commute (t1(1/5) t2(2/3) - t2 t1: max abs)\"]], 3]}, {\"degree check\", ScientificForm[sz[checks[\"exact degree check: coefficient matrices u^(2a+1..6) of t_a vanish (a=1,2), max abs\"]], 3]}, {\"Precision of t-coeffs\", Precision[tzTest[[2, 3]]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
