  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c02_setup_transfer` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c02_setup_transfer\", 0.3, {{\"time (s): all 7 minor families + one twist\", 0.2427106}, {\"qdet dev\", 2.93e-200}, \n  {\"[t1,t2] dev\", 3.97e-194}, {\"degree check\", 0}, {\"Precision of t-coeffs\", 197.20393113884646}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c02_setup_transfer\", 1.3, {{\"time (s): all 7 minor families + one twist\", 1.0465911}, {\"qdet dev\", 5.8e-200}, \n  {\"[t1,t2] dev\", 1.39e-193}, {\"degree check\", 0}, {\"Precision of t-coeffs\", 197.2389882168412}}}\n```",
