  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 0 checks, all exact at rational points. (a) frame tie: OmegaC[w] = OmegaD[z,w] . P_phys(z); (b) exact undo on all HW kets: <OmegaD[w] (x) OmegaD[w']|h> = <e1 rho(n(w) n(w')^-1) (x) e1|h> (with a control showing the test is not vacuous); (c) OmegaD[w] (x) OmegaD[w] is the exact left eigen-covector of t_a(u) with the BRA twist G'(w) = P_aux G(w) P_aux^-1 (G(w) the companion matrix with eigenvalues w; the diagonal-frame image of the companion twist of eigenvalues w; NOT the diagonal matrix diag(w), shown as a control). *)\ntiePts = {{{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {5/2, Infinity}}, {{2, 5/3, -1/2}, {-2, Infinity}}, {{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {5/2, 7/3}}, {{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {-3/2, 4/5}}, {{2, 5/3, -1/2}, {3, -1/3}}, {reg2[10^-6, phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {-12/5, 1/8}][\"z\"], reg2[10^-6, phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {-12/5, 1/8}][\"w\"]}};\n(* the tie holds up to the scalar kappa(z,w) = <e1|rho(n P)|e1> = Prod_k Delta_k(n P3)^(lambda_k - lambda_{k+1}) (Delta_k leading principal minors of the 3x3 matrix n(z,w) P3(z), P3 = the defining-rep image of P_phys): OmegaC is normalised to first component 1, OmegaD . P_phys is not *)\nPphys3[zv_] := MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[1]] e3[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[2]] e3[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[rVec[zv][[3]] e3[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[sVec[zv]] . MatrixExp[(1/zv[[1]]) e3[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) e3[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) e3[2, 3]];\nkappaTie[zv_, w_] := With[{g = nOf[zv, w] . Pphys3[zv]}, Det[g[[1 ;; 1, 1 ;; 1]]]^(Λ[[1]] - Λ[[2]]) Det[g[[1 ;; 2, 1 ;; 2]]]^(Λ[[2]] - Λ[[3]]) Det[g]^Λ[[3]]];\ntieTest[p_] := With[{a = ΩC[p[[2]]], b = ΩD[p[[1]], p[[2]]] . Pphys[p[[1]]]}, {MatrixRank[{a, b}] == 1, b === kappaTie[p[[1]], p[[2]]] a}];\nchecks[\"(a) frame tie OmegaC[w] = OmegaD[z,w] . P_phys(z)/kappa, exact: {parallel, scalar = kappa}, 2 points with w2 = Infinity + 3 finite points + regime point eps = 1e-6\"] = tieTest /@ tiePts;\ncheckInfC = Module[{zz = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}}, Table[N[Max[Abs[ΩD[zz, {5/2, W}] - ΩD[zz, {5/2, Infinity}]]], 5], {W, {10^10, 10^30}}]];\nundoPts = {{{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {5/2, 7/3}, {7/4, -2/5}}, {{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {-3/2, 4/5}, {3, -5/7}}, {{2, 5/3, -1/2}, {3, -1/3}, {-2, 9/5}}};\nundoPts = Join[undoPts, {{{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, {5/2, Infinity}, {7/4, Infinity}}, {{2, 5/3, -1/2}, {3, 7/3}, {-2, Infinity}},With[{R = reg2[10^-6, phiP, {3/4, -1/5}, {-12/5, 1/8}]}, {R[\"z\"], R[\"w\"], R[\"wp\"]}], With[{R = reg2[10^-6, phiC, {-5/3, 5/3}, {7/2, -3/4}]}, {R[\"z\"], R[\"w\"], R[\"wp\"]}]}];\nundoTest[p_] := Module[{zz = p[[1]], w = p[[2]], wp = p[[3]], lhs, rhs, wrong},\n  lhs = kron[ΩD[zz, w], ΩD[zz, wp]]; rhs = kron[phiUof[zz, w, wp], e1]; wrong = kron[ΩD[zz, w], e1];\n  {And @@ (lhs . # === rhs . # & /@ u12HW), Or @@ (lhs . # =!= wrong . # & /@ u12HW)}];\n{tims[\"undo exact\"], undoRes} = AbsoluteTiming[undoTest /@ undoPts];\nchecks[\"(b) exact undo on all HW kets (7 points: 2 with w2 = Infinity, 2 regime points); control: the naive e1 (x) e1 pairing differs\"] = undoRes;\n(* (c) bra-twist eigen-covector *)\nee3 = e3;\nGc[tw_] := {{Total[tw], -(tw[[1]] tw[[2]] + tw[[1]] tw[[3]] + tw[[2]] tw[[3]]), Times @@ tw}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nrsSolP[zv_] := {s1 -> zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), s2 -> -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), s3 -> 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]]), rh1 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), rh2 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), rh3 -> (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPaux[zv_] := (MatrixExp[-rh1 ee3[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-rh2 ee3[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-rh3 ee3[1, 2]] . DiagonalMatrix[1/{s1, s2, s3}] . MatrixExp[-(1/zv[[1]]) ee3[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee3[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee3[3, 2]]) /. rsSolP[zv];\neigTest[zz_, wv_, M_] := With[{O2 = kron[ΩD[zz, wv[[1 ;; 2]]], ΩD[zz, wv[[1 ;; 2]]]]}, Table[With[{c = Normal[O2 . tLg[a, 2/9, M]]}, Union[Flatten[c - (c[[1]]/O2[[1]]) O2]] === {0}], {a, 3}]];\nzE = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wE = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5};\nchecks[\"(c0) Paux diagonalizes the ket companion matrix G(z) to diag(z)\"] = Paux[zE] . Gc[zE] . Inverse[Paux[zE]] === DiagonalMatrix[zE];\nGP = Paux[zE] . Gc[wE] . Inverse[Paux[zE]];\n{tims[\"eigen-covector\"], eigRes} = AbsoluteTiming[{eigTest[zE, wE, GP], eigTest[zE, wE, DiagonalMatrix[wE]]}];\nchecks[\"(c) OmegaD[w] (x) OmegaD[w] left eigen-covector of t_a(2/9), a = 1,2,3: bra twist G'(w); control diag(w)\"] = eigRes;\nGrid[{{\"continuity: max |OmegaD(w2 = 1e10, 1e30) - OmegaD(w2 = Infinity)|\", ToString[checkInfC, InputForm]}, {\"(a) frame tie OmegaC[w] = OmegaD . P_phys / kappa, 6 points (first two: w2 = Infinity): {parallel, scalar = kappa}\", ToString[checks[\"(a) frame tie OmegaC[w] = OmegaD[z,w] . P_phys(z)/kappa, exact: {parallel, scalar = kappa}, 2 points with w2 = Infinity + 3 finite points + regime point eps = 1e-6\"]]}, {\"(b) undo exact on all HW kets, 7 points (2 with w2 = Infinity): {all equal, naive control differs}\", ToString[checks[\"(b) exact undo on all HW kets (7 points: 2 with w2 = Infinity, 2 regime points); control: the naive e1 (x) e1 pairing differs\"]]}, {\"(c0) Paux diagonalizes G(z)\", checks[\"(c0) Paux diagonalizes the ket companion matrix G(z) to diag(z)\"]}, {\"(c) eigen-covector of t_a, a = 1,2,3: twist G'(w); control twist diag(w)\", ToString[checks[\"(c) OmegaD[w] (x) OmegaD[w] left eigen-covector of t_a(2/9), a = 1,2,3: bra twist G'(w); control diag(w)\"]]}, {\"times (s): undo, eigen\", ToString[{tims[\"undo exact\"], tims[\"eigen-covector\"]}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c05_t0_checks` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c05_t0_checks\", 0.26, {{\"continuity: max |OmegaD(w2 = 1e10, 1e30) - OmegaD(w2 = Infinity)|\", \"{2.1694214877479338843071625344e-10, 2.1694214876033057851239669422e-30}\"}, \n  {\"(a) frame tie OmegaC[w] = OmegaD . P_phys / kappa, 6 points (first two: w2 = Infinity): {parallel, scalar = kappa}\", \n   \"{{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}\"}, {\"(b) undo exact on all HW kets, 7 points (2 with w2 = Infinity): {all equal, naive control differs}\", \n   \"{{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}\"}, {\"(c0) Paux diagonalizes G(z)\", True}, \n  {\"(c) eigen-covector of t_a, a = 1,2,3: twist G'(w); control twist diag(w)\", \"{{True, True, True}, {False, False, True}}\"}, {\"times (s): undo, eigen\", \"{0.0077997, 0.135699}\"}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c05_t0_checks\", 0.8300000000000001, {{\"continuity: max |OmegaD(w2 = 1e10, 1e30) - OmegaD(w2 = Infinity)|\", \"{9.4665664919909842224312546957e-10, 9.4665664913598797896318557476e-30}\"}, \n  {\"(a) frame tie OmegaC[w] = OmegaD . P_phys / kappa, 6 points (first two: w2 = Infinity): {parallel, scalar = kappa}\", \n   \"{{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}\"}, {\"(b) undo exact on all HW kets, 7 points (2 with w2 = Infinity): {all equal, naive control differs}\", \n   \"{{True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}, {True, True}}\"}, {\"(c0) Paux diagonalizes G(z)\", True}, \n  {\"(c) eigen-covector of t_a, a = 1,2,3: twist G'(w); control twist diag(w)\", \"{{True, True, True}, {False, False, True}}\"}, {\"times (s): undo, eigen\", \"{0.0156676, 0.668086}\"}}}\n```",
