  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 1. The undone unipotent n′ = n(z,w) n(z,w′)⁻¹, symbolic in ε (exact, 3×3)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1. The undone unipotent n' = n(z,w) n(z,w')^-1 (3x3, exact, symbolic in eps and in all directions). n' = [[1,a',b'],[0,1,c'],[0,0,1]] = exp(a' e12) exp((b'-a'c') e13) exp(c' e23); the three Gauss parameters are (a', c', g' = b' - a'c'), g' the commutator direction that degenerated in the old det6 x det2 family. Regime: z = 1+eps phi, w = 1+eps omega, w' = 1+eps omega'. Orders = exponent of the lowest power of eps (exact, Together); leading coefficient = the eps -> 0 value after dividing out the leading power. *)\nordEps[f_] := With[{t = Together[f]}, If[t === 0, Infinity, Exponent[Numerator[t], ep, Min] - Exponent[Denominator[t], ep, Min]]];\nlead0[f_] := With[{t = Together[f]}, If[t === 0, 0, Factor[Together[t ep^(-ordEps[t])] /. ep -> 0]]];\nsymZ = 1 + ep {f1, f2, f3};\nsymAt[wS_, wpS_] := Module[{np = Map[Together, nPrime[symZ, wS, wpS], {2}]}, {np[[1, 2]], np[[2, 3]], Together[np[[1, 3]] - np[[1, 2]] np[[2, 3]]]}];\nwMain = {1 + ep o1, 1 + ep o2}; wpMain = {1 + ep p1, 1 + ep p2};\n{tims[\"symbolic n'\"], parMain} = AbsoluteTiming[symAt[wMain, wpMain]];\nordsMain = ordEps /@ parMain;\nleadMain = lead0 /@ parMain;\n{a0S, c0S, g0S} = leadMain;\n(* structure of the closed forms (exact): n(w) = [[1, a, b],[0, 1, c],[0, 0, 1]] with a = r1, b = r2 + r1 r3 = (w1 - z1)/(w1 - z3) (independent of w2) and c = r3; hence for n' = n(w) n(w')^-1: a' = a - a'w, c' = c - c'w and g' = b' - a'c' = (b - bw') - (a - aw') c, with c the E23 parameter of w only *)\nrW = rGauss[symZ, 1 + ep o1, 1 + ep o2]; rWp = rGauss[symZ, 1 + ep p1, 1 + ep p2];\nbOf[r_] := r[[2]] + r[[1]] r[[3]];\nchecks[\"T1 b = r2 + r1 r3 = (w1 - z1)/(w1 - z3) is independent of w2 (symbolic)\"] = Simplify[bOf[rW] - (1 + ep o1 - symZ[[1]])/(1 + ep o1 - symZ[[3]])] === 0;\nchecks[\"T1 a' = a - a_w', c' = c - c_w' (exact, symbolic)\"] = Simplify[parMain[[1]] - (rW[[1]] - rWp[[1]])] === 0 && Simplify[parMain[[2]] - (rW[[3]] - rWp[[3]])] === 0;\nchecks[\"T1 g' = (b - b_w') - (a - a_w') c (exact, symbolic)\"] = Simplify[parMain[[3]] - ((bOf[rW] - bOf[rWp]) - (rW[[1]] - rWp[[1]]) rW[[3]])] === 0;\nr0W = lead0 /@ rW; r0Wp = lead0 /@ rWp;\nchecks[\"T1 a'0 = r1_0(om) - r1_0(om'), c'0 = r3_0(om) - r3_0(om') (leading Gauss parameters of the two vacua)\"] = Simplify[a0S - (r0W[[1]] - r0Wp[[1]])] === 0 && Simplify[c0S - (r0W[[3]] - r0Wp[[3]])] === 0;\nchecks[\"T1 g'0 independent of om2' ; a'0 independent of om2, om2' ; c'0 depends on all four\"] = {D[g0S, p2] === 0, D[a0S, o2] === 0 && D[a0S, p2] === 0, And @@ (D[c0S, #] =!= 0 & /@ {o1, o2, p1, p2})};\n(* rank of (o1, o2, p1, p2) -> (a'0, c'0, g'0): Jacobian at generic rational points *)\njac = D[{a0S, c0S, g0S}, {{o1, o2, p1, p2}}];\nrankPts = {{f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> 3/4, o2 -> -1/5, p1 -> -12/5, p2 -> 1/8}, {f1 -> 1/3, f2 -> -2/7, f3 -> 5/11, o1 -> -5/3, o2 -> 9/7, p1 -> 7/2, p2 -> -3/4}, {f1 -> -2/5, f2 -> 3/8, f3 -> 7/11, o1 -> 5/7, o2 -> -11/3, p1 -> 2/9, p2 -> 13/4}};\nranksJ = Table[MatrixRank[jac /. pt], {pt, rankPts}];\n(* is the map (o1, o2, p1, p2) -> (a'0, c'0, g'0) onto an open set with a one-dimensional fibre?  Check by solving for (o2, p1, p2) at fixed o1 given the target values at a sample point *)\nchecks[\"T1 orders of (a', c', g') in the regime (all O(1) expected)\"] = ordsMain;\nchecks[\"T1 rank of the Jacobian of (om1, om2, om1', om2') -> (a'0, c'0, g'0) at 3 generic points\"] = ranksJ;\n(* controls *)\nctl[name_, wS_, wpS_] := Module[{pa = symAt[wS, wpS]}, {name, ordEps /@ pa, If[AllTrue[pa, # === 0 &], \"n' = 1\", \"\"], lead0 /@ pa}];\ny0val = (tPar - 1)/(tPar - 2);\nctlRows = {\n  ctl[\"(i) w' = w exactly\", wMain, wMain],\n  ctl[\"(ii-a) old regime: w2' pinned at y0 (1 + eps om2'), y0 = (t-1)/(t-2), w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", {1 + ep o1, 1 + ep o2}, {1 + ep p1, y0val (1 + ep p2)}],\n  ctl[\"(ii-b) w2' = 7/4 fixed, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", wMain, {1 + ep p1, 7/4}],\n  ctl[\"(ii-c) w' = (7/4, -2/5) fixed (no w' untwisting)\", wMain, {7/4, -2/5}],\n  ctl[\"(iii) common w1' = w1, w2' = 1 + eps om2'\", wMain, {1 + ep o1, 1 + ep p2}],\n  ctl[\"(iv) common w2' = w2, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", wMain, {1 + ep p1, 1 + ep o2}]};\n(* (iii) exactly: only the E23 direction survives, n' = exp(c' E23) with c' = r3(w2) - r3(w2') *)\nchecks[\"T1 (iii) common w1': a' = 0 and g' = 0 exactly (only c' survives)\"] = With[{pa = symAt[wMain, {1 + ep o1, 1 + ep p2}]}, {pa[[1]] === 0, pa[[3]] === 0, pa[[2]] =!= 0}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"a'0 = lim a' (orders of a', c', g')\", ToString[ordsMain, InputForm], ToString[a0S, InputForm]}, {\"c'0\", \"\", ToString[c0S, InputForm]}, {\"g'0 = (b' - a'c')_0\", \"\", ToString[g0S, InputForm]}, {\"rank of Jacobian (3 points)\", ToString[ranksJ, InputForm], \"\"}, {\"b w2-independent; a' = a - a_w', c' = c - c_w'; g' = (b - b_w') - (a - a_w') c; a'0, c'0 = differences of the vacua leading parameters; dependence structure\", ToString[{checks[\"T1 b = r2 + r1 r3 = (w1 - z1)/(w1 - z3) is independent of w2 (symbolic)\"], checks[\"T1 a' = a - a_w', c' = c - c_w' (exact, symbolic)\"], checks[\"T1 g' = (b - b_w') - (a - a_w') c (exact, symbolic)\"], checks[\"T1 a'0 = r1_0(om) - r1_0(om'), c'0 = r3_0(om) - r3_0(om') (leading Gauss parameters of the two vacua)\"], checks[\"T1 g'0 independent of om2' ; a'0 independent of om2, om2' ; c'0 depends on all four\"]}, InputForm], \"\"}, {\"(iii) common w1': {a' = 0, g' = 0, c' != 0}\", ToString[checks[\"T1 (iii) common w1': a' = 0 and g' = 0 exactly (only c' survives)\"], InputForm], \"\"}, {\"controls: name, orders (a', c', g'), note, leading coefficients\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[{r[[1]], ToString[r[[2]], InputForm] <> \" \" <> r[[3]], ToString[r[[4]], InputForm]}, {r, ctlRows}], {{\"time (s)\", tims[\"symbolic n'\"], \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c07_t1_symbolic` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c07_t1_symbolic\", 0.16, {{\"a'0 = lim a' (orders of a', c', g')\", \"{0, 0, 0}\", \"-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1)))\"}, \n  {\"c'0\", \"\", \"((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3*o1 + f2*f3*o2 - f2*o1*o2 - f3*o1*o2 - f2*f3*p1 + o1*o2*p1 - f2*f3*p2 + o1*o2*p2 + f2*p1*p2 + f3*p1*p2 - o1*p1*p2 - o2*p1*p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - \\\no2)*(f3 - p1)*(f3 - p2))\"}, {\"g'0 = (b' - a'c')_0\", \"\", \"((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))\"}, {\"rank of Jacobian (3 points)\", \"{3, 3, 3}\", \"\"}, \n  {\"b w2-independent; a' = a - a_w', c' = c - c_w'; g' = (b - b_w') - (a - a_w') c; a'0, c'0 = differences of the vacua leading parameters; dependence structure\", \n   \"{True, True, True, True, {True, True, True}}\", \"\"}, {\"(iii) common w1': {a' = 0, g' = 0, c' != 0}\", \"{True, True, True}\", \"\"}, \n  {\"controls: name, orders (a', c', g'), note, leading coefficients\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"(i) w' = w exactly\", \"{Infinity, Infinity, Infinity} n' = 1\", \"{0, 0, 0}\"}, \n  {\"(ii-a) old regime: w2' pinned at y0 (1 + eps om2'), y0 = (t-1)/(t-2), w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3 - o1*o2 - \\\nf2*p1 - f3*p1 + o1*p1 + o2*p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), ((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, \n  {\"(ii-b) w2' = 7/4 fixed, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3 - o1*o2 - f2*p1 - f3*p1 + o1*p1 + o2*p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 \\\n- o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), ((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, {\"(ii-c) w' = (7/4, -2/5) fixed (no w' untwisting)\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \n   \"{(f1 - f2)/(f2 - o1), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 + f3 - o1 - o2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)), -(((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)))}\"}, \n  {\"(iii) common w1' = w1, w2' = 1 + eps om2'\", \"{Infinity, 0, Infinity} \", \"{0, ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 - o1)*(o2 - p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p2)), 0}\"}, \n  {\"(iv) common w2' = w2, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 - o2)*(o1 - p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), \\\n((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0096288, \"\"}}}\n```\n\n**[3,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c07_t1_symbolic\", 0.18, {{\"a'0 = lim a' (orders of a', c', g')\", \"{0, 0, 0}\", \"-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1)))\"}, \n  {\"c'0\", \"\", \"((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3*o1 + f2*f3*o2 - f2*o1*o2 - f3*o1*o2 - f2*f3*p1 + o1*o2*p1 - f2*f3*p2 + o1*o2*p2 + f2*p1*p2 + f3*p1*p2 - o1*p1*p2 - o2*p1*p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - \\\no2)*(f3 - p1)*(f3 - p2))\"}, {\"g'0 = (b' - a'c')_0\", \"\", \"((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))\"}, {\"rank of Jacobian (3 points)\", \"{3, 3, 3}\", \"\"}, \n  {\"b w2-independent; a' = a - a_w', c' = c - c_w'; g' = (b - b_w') - (a - a_w') c; a'0, c'0 = differences of the vacua leading parameters; dependence structure\", \n   \"{True, True, True, True, {True, True, True}}\", \"\"}, {\"(iii) common w1': {a' = 0, g' = 0, c' != 0}\", \"{True, True, True}\", \"\"}, \n  {\"controls: name, orders (a', c', g'), note, leading coefficients\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"(i) w' = w exactly\", \"{Infinity, Infinity, Infinity} n' = 1\", \"{0, 0, 0}\"}, \n  {\"(ii-a) old regime: w2' pinned at y0 (1 + eps om2'), y0 = (t-1)/(t-2), w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3 - o1*o2 - \\\nf2*p1 - f3*p1 + o1*p1 + o2*p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), ((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, \n  {\"(ii-b) w2' = 7/4 fixed, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2*f3 - o1*o2 - f2*p1 - f3*p1 + o1*p1 + o2*p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 \\\n- o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), ((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, {\"(ii-c) w' = (7/4, -2/5) fixed (no w' untwisting)\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \n   \"{(f1 - f2)/(f2 - o1), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 + f3 - o1 - o2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)), -(((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)))}\"}, \n  {\"(iii) common w1' = w1, w2' = 1 + eps om2'\", \"{Infinity, 0, Infinity} \", \"{0, ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 - o1)*(o2 - p2))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p2)), 0}\"}, \n  {\"(iv) common w2' = w2, w1' = 1 + eps om1'\", \"{0, 0, 0} \", \"{-(((-f1 + f2)*(o1 - p1))/((f2 - o1)*(f2 - p1))), ((f1 - f3)*(f2 - f3)*(f2 - o2)*(o1 - p1))/((f1 - f2)*(f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)), \\\n((-f1 + f3)*(-f2 + f3)*(o1 - p1)*(o2 - p1))/((f3 - o1)*(f3 - o2)*(f3 - p1)*(-f2 + p1))}\"}, {\"time (s)\", 0.0093622, \"\"}}}\n```",
