  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 1b. Exact finite-twist reach of the undone covector phi_u = e1 rho(n(z,w) n(z,w')^-1) (no untwisting): per one-site weight of V, the rank of the weight-space components over three rational points (z, w, w'), for (i) generic (w, w'), (ii) common w1' = w1 (w2' != w2), (iii) w2 = w2' = Infinity with w1' != w1 (and the control w1' = w1), (iv) w2' = Infinity only, (v) common w2' = w2 (extra). The CG slice at the HW state of weight mu sits at the site-1 weight nu = mu - Lambda; a family is CG-complete (in the sense of the undone covector) iff every slice weight is reached with rank = its dimension. w2 = Infinity means the limit Omega_c -> gaussCov[{1/w1, 0, 1/w1}] (companion frame); the diagonal-frame Gauss parameters are the limits coded in rGauss. *)\nzA = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; zB = {2, 5/3, -1/2}; zC = {-1, 7/3, 1/2};\nfamPts = <|\n  \"(i) generic\" -> {{zA, {5/2, 7/3}, {7/4, -2/5}}, {zB, {3, -1/3}, {-2, 9/5}}, {zC, {-3/2, 4/5}, {3, -5/7}}},\n  \"(ii) common w1' = w1\" -> {{zA, {5/2, 7/3}, {5/2, -2/5}}, {zB, {3, -1/3}, {3, 9/5}}, {zC, {-3/2, 4/5}, {-3/2, 3}}},\n  \"(iii) w2 = w2' = Inf, w1' != w1\" -> {{zA, {5/2, Infinity}, {7/4, Infinity}}, {zB, {3, Infinity}, {-2, Infinity}}, {zC, {-3/2, Infinity}, {3, Infinity}}},\n  \"(iii-c) w2 = w2' = Inf, w1' = w1 (control)\" -> {{zA, {5/2, Infinity}, {5/2, Infinity}}, {zB, {3, Infinity}, {3, Infinity}}, {zC, {-3/2, Infinity}, {-3/2, Infinity}}},\n  \"(iv) w2' = Inf only\" -> {{zA, {5/2, 7/3}, {7/4, Infinity}}, {zB, {3, -1/3}, {-2, Infinity}}, {zC, {-3/2, 4/5}, {3, Infinity}}},\n  \"(v) common w2' = w2\" -> {{zA, {5/2, 7/3}, {7/4, 7/3}}, {zB, {3, -1/3}, {-2, -1/3}}, {zC, {-3/2, 4/5}, {3, 4/5}}}|>;\nphiFam = Association[Table[k -> (phiUof @@ # & /@ famPts[k]), {k, Keys[famPts]}]];\nchecks[\"T1b all points have w_i, w_i' distinct from z_k (vacuum nondegenerate)\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[FreeQ[Join[p[[2]], p[[3]]] /. Infinity -> 99/7, Alternatives @@ p[[1]]], {k, Keys[famPts]}, {p, famPts[k]}]];\nrankOf[ph_, m_] := MatrixRank[Table[v[[idxOf[m]]], {v, ph}]];\nreachTab = Table[{m, Length[idxOf[m]], Sequence @@ Table[rankOf[phiFam[k], m], {k, Keys[famPts]}]}, {m, u12wts}];\nsliceNu = Union[hwSecs - Table[Λ, {Length[hwSecs]}]];\nsliceDim = Table[Length[idxOf[nu]], {nu, sliceNu}];\nfamComplete = Table[And @@ Table[rankOf[phiFam[k], nu] == Length[idxOf[nu]], {nu, sliceNu}], {k, Keys[famPts]}];\nfamIrrepsRead = Table[Length[Select[hwSecs, rankOf[phiFam[k], # - Λ] > 0 &]], {k, Keys[famPts]}];\nfamSumRank = Table[Total[Table[rankOf[phiFam[k], m], {m, u12wts}]], {k, Keys[famPts]}];\nchecks[\"T1b reach table rows {weight, dim, ranks per family}\"] = reachTab;\nGrid[Join[{Join[{\"weight nu\", \"dim\", \"\"}, Keys[famPts]]}, Table[{r[[1]], r[[2]], If[MemberQ[sliceNu, r[[1]]], \"slice\", \"\"], Sequence @@ r[[3 ;;]]}, {r, reachTab}], {{\"sum of ranks (= # directions of V reached; dim V = \" <> ToString[d1] <> \")\", \"\", \"\", Sequence @@ famSumRank}, {\"# HW sectors with a nonzero slice read (of \" <> ToString[Length[hwSecs]] <> \" sectors)\", \"\", \"\", Sequence @@ famIrrepsRead}, {\"CG-complete (all slice weights, full rank)\", \"\", \"\", Sequence @@ famComplete}, {\"vacuum nondegenerate at all points\", checks[\"T1b all points have w_i, w_i' distinct from z_k (vacuum nondegenerate)\"], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
