   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 3 result: chain side, signal vs contamination (cell 10; 200 digits; ε = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6)\n\nR_C = ⟨Φ|Ψ_B⟩, S = ⟨Φ|P_HWΨ_B⟩, K = R_C − S for every HW-limit branch, every grid point, every ε. The **exact undo** S = ⟨φ_u⊗e₁ᵀ|P_HWΨ_B⟩ holds to the accuracy of the working precision at all points (relative deviation below 1e-157 [2,1,0] / 1e-149 [3,1,0], shown per branch; limited only by the 200-digit cancellation in the larger irreps). \"S eps-exp\" and \"K eps-exp\" are the ε-exponents (log₂ of the ratio between consecutive ε, minimum/maximum over the grid points and the two ε pairs); max|K/S| is the maximum over the grid points; the last-but-one column is the ratio of max|K/S| between consecutive ε (O(ε): 2.000).\n\n**Decisive expectation: K/S = O(ε) for EVERY HW branch — CONFIRMED** for the main family, for both reps, including the adjoint singlet and both octets and all ten [3,1,0] branches ([4,4,0], [4,3,1]×2, [4,2,2], [3,3,2] included, which had ε-constant κ in the det₆×det₂ family): max|K/S| doubles with ε (ratios 2.000, 2.000) in all branches; largest values at ε = 1e-6: adjoint 1.5e-5 (octet 1), [3,1,0] 2.0e-5 (copy 2 of [5,2,1]); with φ′ at ε = 1e-6: ≤ 1.6e-5 (adjoint), ≤ 4.4e-5 ([3,1,0]). The top branch has K = 0 exactly (P_HWΨ = Ψ). The same holds for the **control with w′ fixed** (6 points), and for the sub-families **inf2** (w₂ = w₂′ = ∞) and **inf1** (w₂′ = ∞) — all branches, both reps. The sub-family **common1** (w₁′ = w₁) reads only the top irrep and the first one ([4,1,1] / [6,1,1]; K/S = O(ε) there) and does not read any other branch (|S| < 1e-100|R_C|).\n\n#### [2,1,0]: main family (24 points) and controls\n\n**MAIN family (24 points, phi)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 4.25e-7, 8.5e-7, 1.7e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.1e-6, 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 1.5e-5, 3.01e-5, 6.01e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 8.05e-6, 1.61e-5, 3.22e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 2.57e-6, 5.14e-6, 1.03e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n\n**CONTROL w' fixed = (7/4, -2/5) (6 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 6.02e-6, 1.2e-5, 2.41e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 6.52e-7, 1.3e-6, 2.61e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 6.03e-7, 1.21e-6, 2.41e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 1.36e-6, 2.72e-6, 5.45e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 9.91e-7, 1.98e-6, 3.96e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-158 |\n\n**EXTRA w2 = w2' = Infinity (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.22e-6, 4.43e-6, 8.86e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.1e-6, 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 2.72e-6, 5.44e-6, 1.09e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 1.e-5, 2.e-5, 4.e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 2.27e-6, 4.53e-6, 9.07e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n\n**EXTRA w2' = Infinity only (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.89e-5, 5.77e-5, 1.15e-4 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-182 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.1e-6, 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 2.39e-6, 4.78e-6, 9.57e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 3.04e-6, 6.07e-6, 1.21e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 3.77e-6, 7.54e-6, 1.51e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n\n**EXTRA common w1' = w1 (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.33e-7, 4.65e-7, 9.3e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n\n**MAIN family with phi' (24 points, eps = 1e-6 only)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [4,2,0] | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [4,1,1] | 1 | - | - | 7.58e-7 | - | < 1e-183 |\n| [3,3,0] | 1 | - | - | 2.e-6 | - | < 1e-184 |\n| [3,2,1] | 1 | - | - | 2.17e-6 | - | < 1e-174 |\n| [3,2,1] | 2 | - | - | 1.61e-5 | - | < 1e-174 |\n| [2,2,2] | 1 | - | - | 2.6e-6 | - | < 1e-159 |\n\n#### [3,1,0]: main family (24 points) and controls\n\n**MAIN family (24 points, phi)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-191 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 4.25e-7, 8.5e-7, 1.7e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 3.12e-7, 6.24e-7, 1.25e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 5.65e-7, 1.13e-6, 2.26e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 2.e-5, 4.e-5, 8.01e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6, 1.68e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-175 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 3.69e-6, 7.38e-6, 1.48e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-165 |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 1.09e-5, 2.18e-5, 4.36e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-165 |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 4.51e-6, 9.02e-6, 1.8e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | {-7.000, -7.000} | {-6.000, -5.997} | 4.44e-6, 8.88e-6, 1.78e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-149 |\n\n**CONTROL w' fixed = (7/4, -2/5) (6 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-191 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 6.02e-6, 1.2e-5, 2.41e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 9.66e-8, 1.93e-7, 3.86e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 8.68e-7, 1.74e-6, 3.47e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 2.1e-6, 4.2e-6, 8.39e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 1.3e-6, 2.61e-6, 5.22e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-176 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 1.06e-6, 2.12e-6, 4.24e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-166 |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 1.7e-6, 3.41e-6, 6.81e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-167 |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 2.08e-6, 4.16e-6, 8.32e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-158 |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | {-7.000, -7.000} | {-6.000, -6.000} | 1.39e-6, 2.78e-6, 5.56e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-150 |\n\n**EXTRA w2 = w2' = Infinity (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-191 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.22e-6, 4.43e-6, 8.86e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 3.12e-7, 6.24e-7, 1.25e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 3.23e-6, 6.46e-6, 1.29e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-172 |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 5.2e-6, 1.04e-5, 2.08e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-174 |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6, 1.68e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-175 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 1.08e-6, 2.16e-6, 4.33e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-165 |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 1.01e-5, 2.01e-5, 4.03e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-166 |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 3.1e-6, 6.2e-6, 1.24e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | {-7.000, -7.000} | {-6.000, -6.000} | 3.99e-6, 7.99e-6, 1.6e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-149 |\n\n**EXTRA w2' = Infinity only (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-191 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.89e-5, 5.77e-5, 1.15e-4 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-182 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 3.12e-7, 6.24e-7, 1.25e-6 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 1.96e-5, 3.93e-5, 7.86e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-172 |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 3.51e-6, 7.01e-6, 1.4e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-173 |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | {-4.000, -4.000} | {-3.000, -3.000} | 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6, 1.68e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-175 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 3.2e-6, 6.4e-6, 1.28e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-165 |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | {-5.000, -5.000} | {-4.000, -4.000} | 3.56e-6, 7.13e-6, 1.43e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-165 |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | {-6.000, -6.000} | {-5.000, -5.000} | 2.96e-6, 5.91e-6, 1.18e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-157 |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | {-7.000, -7.000} | {-6.000, -6.000} | 6.93e-6, 1.39e-5, 2.77e-5 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-149 |\n\n**EXTRA common w1' = w1 (12 points)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | {-2.000, -2.000} | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-191 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | {-3.000, -3.000} | {-2.000, -2.000} | 2.33e-7, 4.65e-7, 9.3e-7 | 2.000, 2.000 | < 1e-184 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | not read |  |  |  |  |\n\n**MAIN family with phi' (24 points, eps = 1e-6 only)**\n\n| irrep | copy | S eps-exp | K eps-exp | max abs(K/S) at eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6 | ratios (O(eps): 2, 2) | undo rel dev |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [6,2,0] | 1 | - | K=0 | 0 | - | < 1e-192 |\n| [6,1,1] | 1 | - | - | 7.58e-7 | - | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | - | - | 2.96e-7 | - | < 1e-183 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | - | - | 7.5e-6 | - | < 1e-172 |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | - | - | 4.38e-5 | - | < 1e-173 |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | - | - | 4.e-6 | - | < 1e-175 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | - | - | 3.02e-6 | - | < 1e-166 |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | - | - | 2.08e-5 | - | < 1e-166 |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | - | - | 4.1e-6 | - | < 1e-159 |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | - | - | 4.25e-6 | - | < 1e-151 |",
