  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 4. CG data at leading order from the overlap alone",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 4. CG data at leading order from the overlap alone. The HW state B of weight mu has its CG slice at the one-site weight nu = mu - Lambda (site 2 = e1): chain slice c_B(eps) = [P_HW Psi_B] at (GT indices of nu, site-2 index 1). Overlap side: R_C(pt, eps) = phi_u(eps) . c_B + K, so C := R_C/phi_u(0)[slice] -> c_B as eps -> 0 (1-dim slices); for a 2-dim slice the 2x2 system from two grid points with non-parallel phi_u(0)[slice] gives the slice vector. phi_u(0) is the exact eps^0 coefficient vector of phi_u (c0 of phiSeries); for the main family it is also checked against the closed forms (a'0, c'0, g'0) of Task 1. Errors are relative; Richardson (eps = 1e-6, 2e-6, 4e-6) on f = C eps^p, p = -(eps-exponent of the chain slice): R1 = 2 f(e) - f(2e) removes O(eps), R2 = (4 R1(e) - R1(2e))/3 removes O(eps^2). *)\ncgFamily[key_, fam_, ph_] := Module[{pts = fam[\"pts\"], np, ser, phi0, cd, chainSl, expC, out},\n  np = Length[pts]; ser = phiSeries[fam, ph, #] & /@ pts; phi0 = ser[[All, \"c0\"]];\n  cd = Table[chainData[ie, ph], {ie, 3}];\n  Table[Module[{mu = hwList[[ib, 1]], nu, ix, ci, dm, slC, RC, p, res, pairs, cs},\n    nu = mu - Λ; ix = idxOf[nu]; dm = Length[ix];\n    slC = Table[cd[[ie, ib, \"ph\"]][[(ix - 1) d1 + 1]], {ie, 3}];   (* chain slice vector, 3 eps *)\n    RC = Table[T3[key][[ie, ip, ib, \"RC\"]], {ie, 3}, {ip, np}];\n    p = -Round[Log[Norm[slC[[2]]]/Norm[slC[[1]]]]/Log[2]];\n    If[dm == 1,\n      cs = Table[RC[[ie, ip]]/phi0[[ip, ix[[1]]]], {ie, 3}, {ip, np}];  (* extracted slice value *)\n      res = <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"dim\" -> 1, \"p\" -> p, \"spread\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/Mean[cs[[ie]]] - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"err\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/slC[[ie, 1]] - 1]], {ie, 3}],\n        \"fchain\" -> Table[slC[[ie, 1]] epsL[[ie]]^p, {ie, 3}], \"fov\" -> Table[cs[[ie, 1]] epsL[[ie]]^p, {ie, 3}]|>,\n      pairs = Select[Table[{k, k + Floor[np/2]}, {k, Floor[np/2]}], Abs[Det[phi0[[#, ix]]]] > 10^-3 Max[Abs[phi0[[#, ix]]]]^2 &];\n      cs = Table[Table[LinearSolve[phi0[[pr, ix]], RC[[ie, pr]]], {pr, pairs}], {ie, 3}];   (* extracted slice vector per pair *)\n      res = <|\"ib\" -> ib, \"dim\" -> 2, \"p\" -> p, \"npairs\" -> Length[pairs], \"spread\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/(ConstantArray[Mean[cs[[ie]]], Length[pairs]]) - 1]], {ie, 3}], \"err\" -> Table[Max[Abs[cs[[ie]]/ConstantArray[slC[[ie]], Length[pairs]] - 1]], {ie, 3}],\n        \"fchain\" -> Table[slC[[ie]] epsL[[ie]]^p, {ie, 3}], \"fov\" -> Table[cs[[ie, 1]] epsL[[ie]]^p, {ie, 3}], \"cond\" -> Max[Table[Norm[phi0[[pr, ix]]] Norm[Inverse[phi0[[pr, ix]]]], {pr, pairs}]]|>];\n    res], {ib, nb}]];\nrich3[f_] := Module[{r1 = 2 f[[1]] - f[[2]], r2 = 2 f[[2]] - f[[3]]}, (4 r1 - r2)/3];\n(* reference numbers of the earlier notebooks (chain slice normalisation: <x0|Psi> = 1; octet entries are the functional (u+u')C = C1 + 3 C2 of the (1,1,1) slice) *)\nrefNums = If[Λ === {2, 1, 0}, <|{{4, 1, 1}, 1} -> 46.67453891, {{3, 3, 0}, 1} -> 10.92853892, {{2, 2, 2}, 1} -> -5118.538314, {{3, 2, 1}, 1} -> 184.3305612, {{3, 2, 1}, 2} -> -238.5587523|>, If[Λ === {3, 1, 0}, <|{{6, 1, 1}, 1} -> 46.6745, {{5, 3, 0}, 1} -> -36.8838, {{5, 2, 1}, 1} -> -1325.40, {{5, 2, 1}, 2} -> -334.33|>, <||>]];\n{tCG, cgMain} = AbsoluteTiming[cgFamily[\"main\", famMain, phiP]];\ncgFix = cgFamily[\"fixed\", famFixed, phiP]; cgInf2 = cgFamily[\"inf2\", famInf2, phiP]; cgInf1 = cgFamily[\"inf1\", famInf1, phiP];\n(* closed-form regression: eps^0 coefficient vectors of phi_u (main family) equal e1 rho(exp(a'0 E12) exp(g'0 E13) exp(c'0 E23)) from Task 1 *)\nchecks[\"T4 phi_u(0) = closed form (a'0, c'0, g'0) of Task 1, main family, all 24 points + phi'\"] = And @@ Table[With[{rules = Thread[{f1, f2, f3, o1, o2, p1, p2} -> Join[phiP, pt[[1]], pt[[2]]]]}, phiSeries[famMain, phiP, pt][\"c0\"] === coverG[{a0S, g0S, c0S} /. rules]], {pt, famMain[\"pts\"]}];\nfuncOf = <|{{3, 2, 1}, 1} -> {1, 3}, {{3, 2, 1}, 2} -> {1, 3}, {{5, 2, 1}, 1} -> {2, 8}, {{5, 2, 1}, 2} -> {2, 8}|>;\nrowOf[r_] := Module[{ib = r[\"ib\"], lab, rchain, rov, refv, fv},\n  lab = hwList[[ib]];\n  rchain = rich3[r[\"fchain\"]]; rov = rich3[r[\"fov\"]];\n  refv = Lookup[refNums, Key[lab], None]; fv = Lookup[funcOf, Key[lab], None];\n  {lab[[1]], lab[[2]], r[\"dim\"], StringRiffle[fmtE /@ r[\"spread\"][[{1, 3}]], \", \"], StringRiffle[fmtE /@ r[\"err\"], \", \"], If[r[\"err\"][[1]] == 0, \"-\", ToString[N[r[\"err\"][[3]]/r[\"err\"][[1]], 3]]], ToString[N[rchain, 12], InputForm], With[{dv = Max[Abs[rov/rchain - 1]]}, fmtE[dv]], If[refv === None, \"\", ToString[N[If[fv === None, rchain, fv . rchain], 10]] <> \" vs \" <> ToString[refv]]}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"family\", \"mu\", \"copy\", \"slice dim\", \"spread over grid (1e-6, 4e-6)\", \"error vs chain (3 eps)\", \"err ratio 4e-6/1e-6 (O(eps): 4)\", \"Richardson limit of the chain slice, C eps^p (vector for dim 2)\", \"|Richardson overlap/chain - 1| (point 1)\", \"reference check: functional(chain Richardson) vs earlier notebooks (octet / [5,2,1]: functional (1,3) resp. (2,8) of the slice)\"}}, {{\"MAIN family\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[Join[{\"\"}, rowOf[r]], {r, cgMain}], {{\"CONTROL w' fixed\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[Join[{\"\"}, rowOf[r]], {r, cgFix}], {{\"EXTRA w2 = w2' = Infinity\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[Join[{\"\"}, rowOf[r]], {r, cgInf2}], {{\"EXTRA w2' = Infinity only\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}, Table[Join[{\"\"}, rowOf[r]], {r, cgInf1}], {{\"phi_u(0) = closed form of Task 1 (main, 24 pts)\", ToString[checks[\"T4 phi_u(0) = closed form (a'0, c'0, g'0) of Task 1, main family, all 24 points + phi'\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", ToString[N[tCG, 3]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
