   "value": "*Printed output of the code cell `c11_t4_cg` (evaluated in the shared kernel from exactly the saved source; not a native notebook output).*\n\n**[2,1,0] run** (rows of the printed `Grid`, InputForm; first entry = cell id, second = time in s):\n\n```\n{\"c11_t4_cg\", 0.38, {{\"family\", \"mu\", \"copy\", \"slice dim\", \"spread over grid (1e-6, 4e-6)\", \"error vs chain (3 eps)\", \"err ratio 4e-6/1e-6 (O(eps): 4)\", \n   \"Richardson limit of the chain slice, C eps^p (vector for dim 2)\", \"|Richardson overlap/chain - 1| (point 1)\", \n   \"reference check: functional(chain Richardson) vs earlier notebooks (octet / [5,2,1]: functional (1,3) resp. (2,8) of the slice)\"}, {\"MAIN family\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, \n  {\"\", {4, 2, 0}, 1, 1, \"0 (acc 192), 0 (acc 192)\", \"0 (acc 192), 0 (acc 192), 0 (acc 192)\", \"-\", \"2.60946745562130177514792899408284023669\", \"0 (acc 191)\", \"\"}, \n  {\"\", {4, 1, 1}, 1, 1, \"4.68e-7, 1.87e-6\", \"4.25e-7, 8.5e-7, 1.7e-6\", \"4.00\", \"46.67453891138101664186650214244941715801\", \"0 (acc 184)\", \"46.67453891 vs 46.6745\"}, \n  {\"\", {3, 3, 0}, 1, 1, \"1.61e-6, 6.44e-6\", \"2.1e-6, 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6\", \"4.00\", \"10.92853891670459717786336404147854211982\", \"0 (acc 184)\", \"10.92853892 vs 10.9285\"}, \n  {\"\", {3, 2, 1}, 1, 2, \"5.62e-5, 2.25e-4\", \"5.46e-5, 1.09e-4, 2.19e-4\", \"4.00\", \"{248.32705471138436942947535016057436507708, -21.33216449265699220727521732896594683558}\", \"1.23e-18\", \n   \"184.3305612 vs 184.331\"}, {\"\", {3, 2, 1}, 2, 2, \"6.09e-5, 2.43e-4\", \"6.76e-5, 1.35e-4, 2.7e-4\", \"4.00\", \n   \"{11.39883994526888045440123353554756056737, -83.31919742565232362000720777487031912979}\", \"7.34e-18\", \"-238.5587523 vs -238.559\"}, \n  {\"\", {2, 2, 2}, 1, 1, \"2.5e-6, 9.98e-6\", \"2.57e-6, 5.14e-6, 1.03e-5\", \"4.00\", \"-5118.5383144047475578327\", \"1.51e-19\", \"-5118.538314 vs -5118.54\"}, \n  {\"CONTROL w' fixed\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \