53891 vs 46.6745 | 46.6745389114 |\n| [5,3,0] | 1 | 1 | 2.38e-7, 9.54e-7 | 3.12e-7, 6.24e-7, 1.25e-6 | 4.00 | < 1e-183 | -36.88381884 vs -36.8838 | -36.8838188439 |\n| [5,2,1] | 1 | 2 | 3.39e-6, 1.36e-5 | 3.85e-6, 7.71e-6, 1.54e-5 | 4.00 | 5.03e-19 | -1325.402367 vs -1325.4 | (-835.970434496, 43.3173128073) |\n| [5,2,1] | 2 | 2 | 6.75e-6, 2.7e-5 | 8.95e-6, 1.79e-5, 3.58e-5 | 4.00 | 1.86e-19 | -334.3316172 vs -334.33 | (22.7423320599, -47.4770351603) |\n| [4,4,0] | 1 | 1 | 3.22e-6, 1.29e-5 | 4.21e-6, 8.42e-6, 1.68e-5 | 4.00 | 1.66e-19 |  | -115.853020728 |\n| [4,3,1] | 1 | 2 | 3.06e-5, 1.23e-4 | 3.36e-5, 6.71e-5, 1.34e-4 | 4.00 | 1.22e-17 |  | (-3129.70920645, 247.139873999) |\n| [4,3,1] | 2 | 2 | 1.31e-5, 5.25e-5 | 1.39e-5, 2.79e-5, 5.57e-5 | 4.00 | 1.27e-17 |  | (-65.0505836460, 570.310701774) |\n| [4,2,2] | 1 | 2 | 2.78e-6, 1.11e-5 | 3.e-6, 6.01e-6, 1.2e-5 | 4.00 | 6.89e-18 |  | (4647.35409165, -1549.11803055) |\n| [3,3,2] | 1 | 1 | 5.96e-6, 2.38e-5 | 6.93e-6, 1.39e-5, 2.77e-5 | 4.00 | 6.82e-19 |  | 23369.8056448 |",
