  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Task 5. det₆-type data at small ε (preparation for the Q side)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Task 5. The det6-type data of the family at small eps (preparation for the Q side). One grid point (omega, omega') = ((3/4,-1/5), (-12/5, 1/8)), eps = 1e-6 (and 2e-6 for the exponents): the vacuum direct Q's of the bra twists w and w' (degrees vacDeg), the dual Q's of the HW-limit branches, det6[B, F_vac]/Psi_Q for both twists, the check that <Omega_w (x) Omega_w|Psi_B>/(det6/Psi_Q) is a state-independent constant (over all states of the HW sectors), and the four overlaps <Omega_w (x) Omega_w|Psi>, <Omega_w' (x) Omega_w'|Psi>, <Omega_w (x) Omega_w'|Psi>, <Omega_w' (x) Omega_w|Psi> on the HW-limit branches with their eps-exponents. (The two mixed overlaps are NOT det6: they are the Stage C Q-number targets.) *)\npt5 = {{3/4, -1/5}, {-12/5, 1/8}};\ndata5[ie_] := Module[{R = reg2[epsL[[ie]], phiP, pt5[[1]], pt5[[2]]], zz, B, wN, wpN, ov},\n  zz = R[\"z\"]; B = branchesAt[zz]; wN = R[\"w\"]; wpN = R[\"wp\"];\n  ov = Function[{a, b}, With[{va = N[ΩD[zz, a], pr], vb = N[ΩD[zz, b], pr]}, kron[va, vb]]];\n  <|\"R\" -> R, \"B\" -> B, \"ww\" -> ov[wN, wN], \"pp\" -> ov[wpN, wpN], \"wp\" -> ov[wN, wpN], \"pw\" -> ov[wpN, wN]|>];\n{t5a, d51} = AbsoluteTiming[data5[1]]; d52 = data5[2];\n{t5b, {vqW, vqP}} = AbsoluteTiming[{vacQs[d51[\"R\"][\"w3\"]], vacQs[d51[\"R\"][\"w3p\"]]}];\nstates5 = d51[\"B\"][\"states\"];\n{t5c, rat5} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[With[{psi = s[\"psi\"], st = s[\"st\"]}, {(d51[\"ww\"] . psi)/(det6[st, vqW[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st]), (d51[\"pp\"] . psi)/(det6[st, vqP[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st])}], {s, states5}]];\nconstDevOf[l_] := Max[Abs[l/l[[1]] - 1]];\nchecks[\"T5 vacuum Q's: degrees, exact Baxter residual (w, w')\"] = {Exponent[vqW[\"q\"], X], Exponent[vqP[\"q\"], X], vqW[\"res\"], vqP[\"res\"]};\nchecks[\"T5 dual Q degrees = mu_j - L lambda3 (all states, all j)\"] = And @@ Table[Exponent[s[\"qu\"], X] == s[\"mu\"] - nL Λ[[3]], {s, states5}];\nchecks[\"T5 <Omega Omega|Psi>/(det6/Psi_Q) state-independent over all HW-sector states: dev for w, w'\"] = {constDevOf[rat5[[All, 1]]], constDevOf[rat5[[All, 2]]]};\nchecks[\"T5 the constants c_w, c_w' (and ratio to <x0|e1e1>-type normalisation)\"] = {rat5[[1, 1]], rat5[[1, 2]]};\nquant[d_, ib_] := With[{psi = brOf[d[\"B\"], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"psi\"]}, {d[\"ww\"] . psi, d[\"pp\"] . psi, d[\"wp\"] . psi, d[\"pw\"] . psi}];\nq1 = Table[quant[d51, ib], {ib, nb}]; q2 = Table[quant[d52, ib], {ib, nb}];\nexpos5 = Table[Table[N[Log[Abs[q2[[ib, k]]/q1[[ib, k]]]]/Log[2], 5], {k, 4}], {ib, nb}];\n(* the det6 values themselves per branch, and the ratio of the mixed overlap to the geometric mean of the two diagonal ones (an eps-order diagnostic) *)\nd6vals = Table[With[{st = brOf[d51[\"B\"], hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]]][\"st\"]}, {det6[st, vqW[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st], det6[st, vqP[\"F\"]]/psiQ[st]}], {ib, nb}];\nchecks[\"T5 per-branch table {mu, copy, 4 overlaps}\"] = Table[{hwList[[ib]], q1[[ib]]}, {ib, nb}];\nfmtC[x_] := If[x == 0, \"0\", With[{e = Floor[Log10[Abs[x]]]}, ToString[Round[x/10^e, 0.001]] <> \"e\" <> ToString[e]]];\n(* extra: the same four overlaps for the cheap sub-family w2 = w2' = Infinity (w1 = 1 + eps om1, w1' = 1 + eps om1'; no det6 identity here: the bra twist has an infinite eigenvalue, the vacuum is the limit) at (om1, om1') = (3/4, -12/5), eps = 1e-6, 2e-6 *)\ndataInf[ie_] := Module[{eps = epsL[[ie]], zz = 1 + epsL[[ie]] phiP, B, wI, wpI, ov},\n  B = branchesAt[zz]; wI = {1 + eps 3/4, Infinity}; wpI = {1 - eps 12/5, Infinity};\n  ov = Function[{a, b}, kron[N[ΩD[zz, a], pr], N[ΩD[zz, b], pr]]];\n  <|\"B\" -> B, \"ww\" -> ov[wI, wI], \"pp\" -> ov[wpI, wpI], \"wp\" -> ov[wI, wpI], \"pw\" -> ov[wpI, wI]|>];\ndI1 = dataInf[1]; dI2 = dataInf[2];\nqI1 = Table[quant[dI1, ib], {ib, nb}]; qI2 = Table[quant[dI2, ib], {ib, nb}];\nexposI = Table[Table[N[Log[Abs[qI2[[ib, k]]/qI1[[ib, k]]]]/Log[2], 5], {k, 4}], {ib, nb}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\", \"copy\", \"<w w|Psi> (mantissa e exp)\", \"<w' w'|Psi>\", \"<w w'|Psi>\", \"<w' w|Psi>\", \"eps-exponents (ww, pp, wp, pw)\", \"<w w|Psi>/(det6_w/Psi_Q) = c_w (constant)\"}}, Table[{hwList[[ib, 1]], hwList[[ib, 2]], fmtC[q1[[ib, 1]]], fmtC[q1[[ib, 2]]], fmtC[q1[[ib, 3]]], fmtC[q1[[ib, 4]]], StringRiffle[ToString[Round[#, 0.001]] & /@ expos5[[ib]], \", \"], ToString[N[q1[[ib, 1]]/d6vals[[ib, 1]], 6], InputForm]}, {ib, nb}], Table[{\"w2 = w2' = Inf: \" <> ToString[hwList[[ib, 1]]] <> \" #\" <> ToString[hwList[[ib, 2]]], \"\", fmtC[qI1[[ib, 1]]], fmtC[qI1[[ib, 2]]], fmtC[qI1[[ib, 3]]], fmtC[qI1[[ib, 4]]], StringRiffle[ToString[Round[#, 0.001]] & /@ exposI[[ib]], \", \"], \"(no det6 identity)\"}, {ib, nb}], {{\"vacuum Q degrees (w, w'), exact Baxter residuals\", ToString[{checks[\"T5 vacuum Q's: degrees, exact Baxter residual (w, w')\"][[1 ;; 2]], N[checks[\"T5 vacuum Q's: degrees, exact Baxter residual (w, w')\"][[3 ;; 4]], 3]}, InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"dual Q degrees = mu_j (all states)\", ToString[checks[\"T5 dual Q degrees = mu_j - L lambda3 (all states, all j)\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"<Om Om|Psi>/(det6/Psi_Q) state-independent over all HW-sector states: dev (w, w')\", ToString[fmtE /@ checks[\"T5 <Omega Omega|Psi>/(det6/Psi_Q) state-independent over all HW-sector states: dev for w, w'\"]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"# states checked, constants c_w, c_w'\", ToString[{Length[states5], N[rat5[[1, 1]], 6], N[rat5[[1, 2]], 6]}, InputForm], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"time (s)\", ToString[N[{t5a, t5b, t5c}, 3]], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
